              Berapa lama estimasi pengiriman sepatu?
              <span class="shrink-0 text-ink/40 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180">↓</span>
            </summary>
            <p class="text-[15px] text-ink/65 font-normal leading-relaxed pb-7 pr-10">
              Area Jawa Timur & Jawa Tengah 1-3 hari kerja. Jabodetabek 2-4 hari kerja, dan luar Pulau Jawa 3-7 hari kerja.
            </p>
          </details>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    {/* SIZE CHART — garis pemisah saja, tanpa kotak/tabel tertutup */}
    <section id="size-chart" class="pb-24">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <span class="block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-brass mb-5">Panduan</span>
          <h2 class="display-font text-4xl md:text-5xl font-normal text-ink leading-[1.25]">Ukuran Kaki</h2>
          <div class="w-12 h-px bg-brass mx-auto mt-6"></div>
